WEBVTT

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:01.216
"But did you become
better friends?" I asked.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:04.896
"Did you feel like you got to really
know each other after doing the study?"

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.216
He nodded.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.176
"So, then it worked," I said.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:13.416
I don't think this is the answer
he was looking for.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:17.776
In fact, I don't think this is the answer
that any of us are looking for

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:20.056
when it comes to love.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.816
I first came across this study

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.296
when I was 29

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:26.736
and I was going through
a really difficult breakup.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:29.376
I had been in the relationship
since I was 20,

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.176
which was basically my entire adult life,